    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Feature Description\n\nI mean like the colored text in mIRC i.e. if two people are chatting, both should be able to see the color change. I do not mean the theme colors but the colors in the actual message text. Perhaps with some kind of in-line codes or tags embedded in the message itself. It should work for individual words, even letters, as well as whole messages.\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [ ] I would like to contribute to this feature",
